    "detailed_description": "Blockies VR is a single player action-puzzle game where you knock down block buildings and protect friendly Blockies against the forces of evil. Launch a wide range of objects at enemies in this low-poly physics world. Travel to the Kingdom\u2019s shop to expand your weapon arsenal to take on the most difficult puzzles in all the land.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1835010/extras/16bc774896d0d85befefb4102b43d21d.poster.avif?t=1655152854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1835010/extras/16bc774896d0d85befefb4102b43d21d.webm?t=1655152854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1835010/extras/16bc774896d0d85befefb4102b43d21d.mp4?t=1655152854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A dozen types of blocks that interact uniquely with the world <br></li><li>A dozen AI enemy types each with their own abilities <br></li><li>Levels where you must defend the Blockies from monster attacks <br></li><li>Levels with intricate block puzzles to solve <br></li><li>The Kingdom where cool new projectiles can be purchased <br></li><li>Beautifully designed low poly environments <br></li><li>At least 10 levels with block-based and enemy-based levels</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Level Editor to create and share new levels <br></li><li>Co-op and Multiplayer Functionality <br></li><li>40 more levels</li></ul><br>Join the Discord to learn more about future updates, and provide your own feedback of what you want in the game!",
    "about_the_game": "Blockies VR is a single player action-puzzle game where you knock down block buildings and protect friendly Blockies against the forces of evil. Launch a wide range of objects at enemies in this low-poly physics world. Travel to the Kingdom\u2019s shop to expand your weapon arsenal to take on the most difficult puzzles in all the land.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1835010/extras/16bc774896d0d85befefb4102b43d21d.poster.avif?t=1655152854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1835010/extras/16bc774896d0d85befefb4102b43d21d.webm?t=1655152854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1835010/extras/16bc774896d0d85befefb4102b43d21d.mp4?t=1655152854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A dozen types of blocks that interact uniquely with the world <br></li><li>A dozen AI enemy types each with their own abilities <br></li><li>Levels where you must defend the Blockies from monster attacks <br></li><li>Levels with intricate block puzzles to solve <br></li><li>The Kingdom where cool new projectiles can be purchased <br></li><li>Beautifully designed low poly environments <br></li><li>At least 10 levels with block-based and enemy-based levels</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Level Editor to create and share new levels <br></li><li>Co-op and Multiplayer Functionality <br></li><li>40 more levels</li></ul><br>Join the Discord to learn more about future updates, and provide your own feedback of what you want in the game!",
